message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Formal Trika — machine-checked Śaiva formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "prx0r"
    given-names: "box agent"
    affiliation: "prx0r"
repository-code: "https://github.com/prx0r/trika-x"
abstract: >
  Lean 4 formalization of Trika Śaiva concepts: malas, kañcukas,
  experiential stations, recognition (pratyabhijñā), upāya means, and
  grace — with pre-registration, control/mutant discipline, evidence
  chain to translation-work gold, and honest scope limits (finite models
  only; never a claim about minds or metaphysical truth).
keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formal verification"
  - "Trika Śaivism"
  - "pratyabhijñā"
  - "Abhidhamma method"
  - "pre-registration"
